{"question": "How do I verify the webhook signature?", "answer": "1. Read the **exact raw request body bytes**, before parsing JSON.\n2. Compute an **HMAC-SHA256** over those bytes, using your **webhook secret** as the key—not your API token.\n3. Hex-encode the result and compare it with the `X-TechStore-Signature` header.\n\nDon’t compute the signature over parsed and re-serialised JSON: changes to whitespace or key order change the HMAC and are the most common cause of **403** errors from the delivery checker.", "model": "gpt-6.1-sol", "retriever": "embedding", "retrieved": ["api_webhook_signature", "api_webhook_events", "api_webhook_retries", "api_idempotency"], "orders_used": [], "prompt_tokens": 1441, "cached_prompt_tokens": 0, "cache_write_tokens": 1438, "completion_tokens": 110, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "finish_reason": "stop", "temperature_used": null, "reasoning_effort": null, "answer_length": "default", "verbosity": null, "system_prompt": "system_prompt.txt", "system_prompt_sha": "b0eadd84", "cost_usd": 0.004701, "cost_is_estimate": false, "latency_ms": 2928.2, "retrieval_ms": 17.17, "error": null, "trace_id": "a83e6c0235b0b11d08a328ca5c72d204", "served_by": "model", "faq_id": null, "faq_score": null, "cache_kind": null, "cache_score": null, "cached_question": null, "cache_note": null, "turn": 9, "memory_mode": "off", "memory_dropped_turns": 0, "memory_cost_usd": 0.0, "client_id": null, "limit_action": "allow", "limit_reason": "no client limits", "via_gateway": false, "prompt_layout": "classic", "sent_user_message": "How do I verify the webhook signature?", "conversation_id": "c04+c05+c06", "id": "c04+c05+c06-9"}
